ttps://glossary.missouri.edu/term/memorial-union/","source_title":"Memorial Union — Mizzou Glossary","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://map.missouri.edu/","access_notes":"Located at 518 Hitt St.; accessible entrances and elevators are documented on the Union’s visit page.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mizzou-ellis-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Ellis Library","title":"Settle into Ellis Library","subtitle":"Friday evening · 520 S. 9th Street","notes":"Choose an individual or group study area for a calm reset, and check the library’s current hours before planning a late-evening return.","short_summary":"Mizzou’s main library, with spaces for solo and group study.","evidence_claim":"Mizzou Libraries identifies Ellis as the main library for most undergraduates and says it has individual and group study spaces.","source_url":"https://library.missouri.edu/welcome/","source_title":"Welcome to the Mizzou Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://map.missouri.edu/","access_notes":"The library page lists regular access from Sunday 10 a.m. through Friday 7 p.m., plus Saturday 10 a.m.–7 p.m.; verify current hours before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mizzou-museum-of-art-and-archaeology","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Museum of Art and Archaeology","title":"Browse the museum galleries","subtitle":"Saturday midday · Ellis Library east wing","notes":"Enter through the museum’s Lowry Mall or accessible Hitt Street entrance, browse at your pace, and leave food, drinks, flash photography, and backpacks outside.","short_summary":"A free art-and-archaeology museum inside Ellis Library.","evidence_claim":"The Museum of Art & Archaeology is in Ellis Library’s east wing, is open to the community, and always has free admission.","source_url":"https://maa.missouri.edu/visit-tours","source_title":"Visit & Tours — Museum of Art and Archaeology","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://map.missouri.edu/","access_notes":"Regular gallery hours are Tuesday–Friday 10 a.m.–4 p.m. and Saturday–Sunday noon–4 p.m.; closed on University observed holidays.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mizzou-peace-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Peace Park","title":"Take a quiet loop in Peace Park","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · north edge of campus","notes":"Walk across McAlester Bridge, choose a bench for a short pause, and stay on established paths while taking in this wooded campus setting.","short_summary":"A wooded campus park with benches and McAlester Bridge.","evidence_claim":"Mizzou describes Peace Park as a four-acre, wooded area on the northern edge of campus with McAlester Bridge and park benches.","source_url":"https://missouri.edu/about/traditions","source_title":"Traditions — Mizzou","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://map.missouri.edu/","access_notes":"Outdoor campus destination; use the campus map and follow posted conditions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mizzou-mu-student-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"MU Student Center","title":"Use the MU Student Center as a reset","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · campus community center","notes":"Stop by to orient yourself to campus services, relax with friends, or check what programming is posted; confirm individual venue access at the building.","short_summary":"One of Mizzou’s two student-union community centers.","evidence_claim":"Missouri Student Unions says the MU Student Center and Memorial Student Union serve as campus community centers with services, study, food and programming.","source_url":"https://unions.missouri.edu/","source_title":"Missouri Student Unions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://map.missouri.edu/","access_notes":"Specific services, food venues and events can have separate schedules or access requirements.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mizzourec-trail","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"MizzouRec Trail","title":"Walk the MizzouRec Trail","subtitle":"Sunday morning · campus connection to MKT","notes":"Choose a comfortable out-and-back stretch in daylight, bring water, and use the trail as a low-key connection between campus and Columbia’s larger trail network.","short_summary":"A 1.5-mile campus trail that connects to Columbia’s MKT system.","evidence_claim":"MizzouRec describes the MizzouRec Trail as a 1.5-mile trail connecting campus to Columbia’s MKT and trail system.","source_url":"https://mizzourec.missouri.edu/facilities/","source_title":"Facilities — MizzouRec","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://map.missouri.edu/","access_notes":"Outdoor route; check weather, daylight and current trail conditions before setting out.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mizzou-stankowski-field","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Stankowski Field","title":"Finish at Stankowski Field","subtitle":"Sunday daytime · 1000 Rollins Street area","notes":"End the weekend with a daylight walk or run on the track, then head back to campus; confirm any field restrictions before using athletic surfaces.","short_summary":"An outdoor recreation area with a track and synthetic-turf fields.","evidence_claim":"MizzouRec says Stankowsk